# Reference library: keep the labeled screenshots (*.png), NOT the bulky raw
# recordings or derived frame dumps (applies to every <client>/shots/ folder).
*.mp4
*.MP4
*.mov
*.MOV
*.webm
*.MKV
*.mkv
frames/
sheets/
scenes/
full/

# Ad-hoc crops taken while writing a screen-map are working artefacts, not
# evidence anyone else needs; a crop that IS cited in a screen-map gets a
# meaningful .png name and is committed (e.g. boris/shots/navicons.png).
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.JPG
